nt\">Microsoft Power Point\u00ae</a> or compatible software like <a href=\"https://www.openoffice.org/download/index.html\" title=\"Download Open Office\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Office</a> to read POT, POTX, PPS, PPSX, PPT or PPTX files.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"docx-plugin\">\r\n<p class=\"h4\">Microsoft Word\u00ae</p>\r\n<div>You will need <a href=\"https://www.microsoft.com/en-US/microsoft-365/word\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" title=\"Download Microsoft Word\">Microsoft Word\u00ae</a> or compatible software like <a href=\"https://www.openoffice.org/download/index.html\" title=\"Download Open Office\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open Office</a> to read DOC, DOT, DOCX or DOTX files.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div id=\"pdf-plugin\">\r\n<p class=\"h4\">Adobe Portable Document Format</p>\r\n<div>You will need <a href=\"https://get.adobe.com/reader/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Adobe Acrobat Reader\u00ae</a> or compatible software like <a href=\"https://www.sumatrapdfreader.org/download-free-pdf-viewer.html\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Download SumatraPDF\" rel=\"noopener\">SumatraPDF</a> to read PDF files.</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n                <div class=\"social-links center\">\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/ChooseSamford/\" class=\"social-link facebook-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Find us on Facebook\"><img src=\"/Templates/images/clear.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"Facebook Icon\"/></a>\r\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/choosesamford/\" class=\"social-link instagram-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Follow us on Instagram\"><img src=\"/Templates/images/clear.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"Instagram Icon\"/></a>\r\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://twitter.com/choosesamford\" class=\"social-link x-link\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"Follow Us on X\"><img src=\"/Templates/images/clear.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"